# 2. Tell RxnCo where its neighbors live using relative paths
Pkg.develop(path="../Equilibrium Constants")
Pkg.develop(path="../Fugacity Coefficients")

Step 2: Update the Sub-Module Code

Now that the link exists in the Project.toml of RxnCo, you can update the code inside Modules/Reaction Coordinates/src/RxnCo.jl.

