Yes, that changes the path slightly. Since you added an extra layer to the folder hierarchy during generation, you need to point develop to the folder that actually contains the Project.toml file.
The Path Adjustment

If you ran generate "Modules/Equilibrium Constants/BioMethEQK", Julia created a structure like this: Modules/Equilibrium Constants/BioMethEQK/Project.toml

When you use the develop command, you must point to that innermost folder.

